  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/656/656-17.htm",
  "statuteText": "656:17 Endorsement. –\n\nOn each state general election ballot shall be printed the words \"Official ballot for\" followed by the name of the town for which the ballot is prepared, the date of the state general election and a facsimile of the signature of the secretary of state."
